@base = http://localhost:8080

### List active creators
GET {{base}}/api/users?role=CREATOR&status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json

### Create user
POST {{base}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "creator_test1",
  "email": "test1@example.com",
  "role": "CREATOR",
  "ratePerPost": 500000,
  "maxDailyPosts": 3,
  "level": 1
}

### Set userId from response
@userId = 1

### Partial user update
PUT {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "changed@example.com"}

### Create campaign with an ACTIVE user
POST {{base}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "advertiserName": "Shop ABC",
  "advertiserEmail": "ads@example.com",
  "advertiserPhone": "0900000000",
  "startDate": "25/07/2026",
  "endDate": "28/07/2026",
  "numberOfPosts": 2,
  "userId": {{userId}}
}

### Set postId from response
@postId = 1

### Detail embeds user object
GET {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Partial update recalculates price
PUT {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endDate": "27/07/2026"}

### Filter and paginate
GET {{base}}/api/posts?advertiserName=Shop&status=SCHEDULED&page=0&size=10

### Validation must return HTTP 406 / status 2
PUT {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"endDate": "25/07/2026"}

### Cancel campaign
DELETE {{base}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Deactivate user
DELETE {{base}}/api/users/{{userId}}
